              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khate la Naamani lidzakumatirira iwe ndi zidzukulu zako mpaka muyaya.\" Ndipo Gehazi anachoka pamaso pa Elisa ali ndi khate lotuwa ngati phulusa.",
          "type": "text",
